[[Open This|hubris]]

---

Hubris is extreme, excessive pride, arrogance, or dangerous overconfidence, often leading to a person's downfall. 

It frequently describes a belief that one is more capable or superior to others, resulting in ignored warnings, complacency, and, in Greek tragedy, divine punishment.

It implies a, sometimes fatal, superiority complex.